  - X-ray Photoelectron Spectroscopy
  - XPS
  - KherveFitting
  - CasaXPS
  - Wine
abstract:
  nomad-north-xps is a NOMAD NORTH plugin bundling XPS peak-fitting GUI tools on top of the
  pynxtools-xps conversion tooling (https://github.com/FAIRmat-NFDI/pynxtools-xps). By default it
  runs KherveFitting (https://github.com/KherveFitting/KherveFitting), an open-source XPS peak
  fitting tool.

  CasaXPS (http://www.casaxps.com/), a commercial XPS analysis tool, can be added via Wine, but
  only as a local build - it is never CI-built or published, since its licensing terms don't
  contain redistribution rights. The installer and licensed Wine prefix are never committed to
  this repository, but license holders can built a local version containing CasaXPS themselves.

  nomad-north-xps is developed as a plugin for NOMAD, an open-source data management platform
  for materials science (https://nomad-lab.eu/nomad-lab/).

  The work is funded by the Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG, German Research Foundation) -
  460197019 (FAIRmat) (https://gepris.dfg.de/project/460197019).
